 *
 * - In bypass mode (IGRP_PREVIEW_MODE or AUTH_PROVIDER=none): returns a stub session.
 * - Otherwise: calls getSession() which handles expired tokens (redirects to /logout).
 * - If no session exists: redirects to /login.
